{"id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses.md","title":"Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates","display":"df-tseitin-gate-clauses — Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses","aliases":["72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses"],"display":"df-tseitin-gate-clauses — Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates","depends_on":["[[72-df-clause-semantics]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; gate CNFs explicitly expanded locally","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"Four Boolean gate equivalences proved by truth tables and implications","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tseitin-gate-clauses — Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"72-df-clause-semantics\">72-df-clause-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; gate CNFs explicitly expanded locally"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Four Boolean gate equivalences proved by truth tables and implications"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\ne x,e\\ne y\">\\(e\\ne x,e\\ne y\\)</span>；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Clause}\">\\(\\mathsf{Clause}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7ea013f9a55dcda\" href=\"?note=a7ea013f9a55dcda\" title=\"72-df-clause-semantics\">72-df-clause-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li>门标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2,3\">\\(0,1,2,3\\)</span> 分别是复制、否定、合取、析取的形式标识；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 表示有限序列。门函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_t\">\\(b_t\\)</span> 与子句集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 在 Assertion 给出，定义域也在该节固定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r(0)=r(1):=1,\\qquad r(2)=r(3):=2,\\qquad\n\\mathcal G:=\\{(e,t,\\vec x):e\\in\\mathsf{PV},\\ t\\in\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathsf{PV}^{r(t)},\\ e\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r(0)=r(1):=1,\\qquad r(2)=r(3):=2,\\qquad\n\\mathcal G:=\\{(e,t,\\vec x):e\\in\\mathsf{PV},\\ t\\in\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathsf{PV}^{r(t)},\\ e\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_0(u):=u,\\quad b_1(u):=1-u,\\quad\nb_2(u,v):=\\min(u,v),\\quad b_3(u,v):=\\max(u,v)\\quad(u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_0(u):=u,\\quad b_1(u):=1-u,\\quad\nb_2(u,v):=\\min(u,v),\\quad b_3(u,v):=\\max(u,v)\\quad(u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD(e,0,\\langle x\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{e,\\neg x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,1,\\langle x\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,2,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{\\neg e,y\\},\\{e,\\neg x,\\neg y\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,3,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,\\neg y\\},\\{\\neg e,x,y\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD(e,0,\\langle x\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{e,\\neg x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,1,\\langle x\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,2,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{\\neg e,y\\},\\{e,\\neg x,\\neg y\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,3,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&amp;:=\\{\\{e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,\\neg y\\},\\{\\neg e,x,y\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(e,t,\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\bigl(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}D(e,t,\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\na(e)=b_t(a(x_0),\\ldots,a(x_{r(t)-1}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(e,t,\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\bigl(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}D(e,t,\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\na(e)=b_t(a(x_0),\\ldots,a(x_{r(t)-1}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第VIII章 §8.4，印刷p.599/PDF p.611，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\\leftrightarrow A\">\\(q_A\\leftrightarrow A\\)</span> 的CNF子句作为扩展公理；书中明确展示否定门的两条子句。本节点逐门展开复制、否定、合取和析取的全部子句。</p>\n<p>逐项核对：复制门排除两个不同值；否定门排除两个相同值。合取门的前两条给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\to x,y\">\\(e\\to x,y\\)</span>，第三条给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x\\land y)\\to e\">\\((x\\land y)\\to e\\)</span>；析取门对偶。最后的等价式是本地四种有限真值表验证，亦覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span> 时集合去重的情况。新定义的四分支按标签互斥且覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-clause-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clause-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-clause-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a7ea013f9a55dcda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{PV}$，$e\\ne x,e\\ne y$；允许 $x=y$。$\\mathsf{Clause}$ 取 [[72-df-clause-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\ne x,e\\ne y","display":false},{"tex":"x=y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Clause}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2,3","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"b_t","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"r(0)=r(1):=1,\\qquad r(2)=r(3):=2,\\qquad\n\\mathcal G:=\\{(e,t,\\vec x):e\\in\\mathsf{PV},\\ t\\in\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathsf{PV}^{r(t)},\\ e\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"b_0(u):=u,\\quad b_1(u):=1-u,\\quad\nb_2(u,v):=\\min(u,v),\\quad b_3(u,v):=\\max(u,v)\\quad(u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD(e,0,\\langle x\\rangle)&:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{e,\\neg x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,1,\\langle x\\rangle)&:=\\{\\{\\neg e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,x\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,2,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&:=\\{\\{\\neg e,x\\},\\{\\neg e,y\\},\\{e,\\neg x,\\neg y\\}\\},\\\\\nD(e,3,\\langle x,y\\rangle)&:=\\{\\{e,\\neg x\\},\\{e,\\neg y\\},\\{\\neg e,x,y\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall(e,t,\\vec x)\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\n\\bigl(a\\models_{\\rm cnf}D(e,t,\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow\na(e)=b_t(a(x_0),\\ldots,a(x_{r(t)-1}))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"q_A\\leftrightarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"e\\to x,y","display":false},{"tex":"(x\\land y)\\to e","display":false},{"tex":"x=y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false}],"bytes":2737,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses|df-tseitin-gate-clauses — Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates]]"},{"id":"a06ff8011d8167f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F$ 是有限子句集合；$V$ 为有限命题变量集合，$V(F)\\subseteq V$。$D,r,\\mathcal G$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]，$\\operatorname{ResRefutation}$ 取 [[72-df-resolution-system]]。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]"},{"id":"9192b374640dde9c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"命题公式构造子、$\\operatorname{Var}$ 和 $⟦ A⟧_a$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；门子句 $D$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses|df-tseitin-gate-clauses — Tseitin clauses for Boolean gates]]"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]"}],"outgoing":["a7ea013f9a55dcda"]}